>Boemare</surname><given-names>NE</given-names></name><name><surname>Akhurst</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Biochemical and physiological characterization of colony form variants in <italic>Xenorhabdus </italic>spp</article-title><source>Journal of General Microbiology</source><year>1988</year><volume>123</volume><fpage>751</fpage><lpage>761</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Turlin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Pascal</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rousselle</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Lenormand</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Ngo</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Danchin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Derzelle</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proteome analysis of the phenotypic variation process in <italic>Photorhabdus luminescens</italic></article-title><source>Proteomics</source><year>2006</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>2705</fpage><lpage>2725</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16548063</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/pmic.200500646</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Duchaud</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Rusniok</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Frangeul</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchrieser</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Givaudan</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Taourit</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Bocs</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Boursaux-Eude</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Chandler</surname><giv